												"name": "Paragraph",
												"type": "textarea",
												"html": "<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"line-height:normal;\"><b>Alternates </b>- If you cannot pick up your food yourself, you must attend at least once each year (July-June) to sign paperwork and assign an alternate to make your pickups. Assigned alternates must bring a picture ID! Alternates can also pick up for a previously registered applicant with a written note from the applicant. Still they would need to provide a new note at each pick-up until the applicant officially assigned them as an alternate on our SDI form.</span>\n</p>",
