												"draggable": true,
												"content": "Alternates - If you cannot pick up your food yourself, you must attend at least once each year (July-June) to sign paperwork and assign an alternate to make your pickups. Assigned alternates must bring a picture ID! Alternates can also pick up for a previously registered applicant with a written note from the applicant. Still they would need to provide a new note at each pick-up until the applicant officially assigned them as an alternate on our SDI form.",
